# Copy to .env.local (git-ignored); Expo loads it on `make mobile` and inlines EXPO_PUBLIC_* values.
# Clerk dashboard > API keys > Publishable key. Never put the secret key (sk_...) here: the app
# doesn't need it, and anything EXPO_PUBLIC_ ends up inside the app bundle.
EXPO_PUBLIC_CLERK_PUBLISHABLE_KEY=pk_test_...
# Optional: the API to use (default: this Mac; `make mobile HOST_IP=...` sets it for a phone).
# EXPO_PUBLIC_API_URL=http://192.168.1.20:8000
# Optional: RevenueCat's public SDK keys (RevenueCat > Project settings > API keys), so this build
# can sell Pro (ADR-0016). Public by design, unlike the secret sk_ key the server uses. Unset:
# the app shows no purchase. EAS builds get them from the EAS environment (docs/billing.md).
# EXPO_PUBLIC_REVENUECAT_IOS_KEY=appl_...
# EXPO_PUBLIC_REVENUECAT_ANDROID_KEY=goog_...
